    {
      "id": "EA03",
      "group": "通信回调换方案",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "from": "MainWindowData通信回调报文门",
      "to": "跳过2字节UTF8 → GetSolItem",
      "behavior": "nLen<2或pData==Zero早退，否则分配nLen字节、Marshal.Copy全部字节，再从offset2解码剩余UTF8；这里没有可见的前缀内容校验、Trim或末尾零裁剪。GetSolItem以CommString==command且CommEnable取首个匹配项，未匹配返回，不按文件路径直接执行消息。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VisionMaster.Exe.Audit/VisionMaster/MainWindowData.cs",
          "member": "communication receive packet gate",
          "sha256": "aa7a20533b81452cd58fbd22e121273b3a109ce21b0841fc0d9e4d081939f1e5",
          "start": 1247,
          "end": 1264,
          "excerpt": "\tprivate void VmSolution_OnCommunicationRecvCallBackEvent(ImvsSdkDefine.IMVS_COMMU_REPORT_DATA_INFO reportDataInfo)\n\t{\n\t\tif (reportDataInfo.nLen < 2 || reportDataInfo.pData == IntPtr.Zero)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t}\n\t\tbyte[] array = new byte[reportDataInfo.nLen];\n\t\tMarshal.Copy(reportDataInfo.pData, array, 0, reportDataInfo.nLen);\n\t\tstring text = Encoding.UTF8.GetString(array, 2, array.Length - 2);\n\t\tSolItem solItem = SolutionData.GetSolItem(text);\n\t\tLogHelper.Debug($\"VmSolutionCommad={text},solcommItemIsNull={solItem == null}\");\n\t\tif (solItem == null)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t}\n\t\tbool loadSolutionResult = true;\n\t\ttry\n\t\t{",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        },
        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VisionMaster.Exe.Audit/VisionMaster.AppMainWindow/SolutionItemsData.cs",
          "member": "SolutionItemsData.GetSolItem",
          "sha256": "b4dd98e35c3e0df52a07e23f804da35877458f4604d9b4789a108b1e98747c0c",
          "start": 295,
          "end": 298,
          "excerpt": "\tpublic SolItem GetSolItem(string command)\n\t{\n\t\treturn SolItems.FirstOrDefault((SolItem x) => x.CommString == command && x.CommEnable);\n\t}",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        }
      ],
      "unknowns": [
        "前2字节的协议含义、上游长度合法性、最大包长、零/无效UTF8、相同字符串多项的实际排序和远端鉴权未证；不能将无本地校验扩写成整个产品没有校验。"
      ],
      "nextMembers": [
        "IMVS_COMMU_REPORT_DATA_INFO declaration and native producer",
        "SolItem.CommString / CommEnable setters and XML declarations"
      ],
      "priorLinks": [],
      "completion": "not-established",
      "verification": {
        "sourceHashesVerified": true,
        "runtimeExecuted": false,
        "nativeEquivalent": false,
        "currentImplementationMapped": false
