    {
      "id": "EA04",
      "group": "通信回调换方案",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "from": "匹配SolItem且未正在加载",
      "to": "ProjectManager.LoadSolution精确参数",
      "behavior": "本地isLoading为true早退；否则置true并启动复位轮询Task。只有IVmSolution.IsLoading为false才调用LoadSolution，传SolPath、isGuid=false、SolPassword为null时空串、afterTask=null、remote/start/args均false，以及快照isShowSaveNotice==\"1\"。空串是明确传入密码，不是null触发交互密码窗；后续密码校验/保存提示/兼容转换链见既有方案打开视图，不能跳过。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VisionMaster.Exe.Audit/VisionMaster/MainWindowData.cs",
          "member": "receive load state and exact call arguments",
          "sha256": "aa7a20533b81452cd58fbd22e121273b3a109ce21b0841fc0d9e4d081939f1e5",
          "start": 1262,
          "end": 1286,
          "excerpt": "\t\tbool loadSolutionResult = true;\n\t\ttry\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tif (isLoading)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tisLoading = true;\n\t\t\tTask.Run(() =>\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\twhile (!((IVmSolution)VmSolution.Instance).IsLoading && loadSolutionResult)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tThread.Sleep(1);\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\tisLoading = false;\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tif (!((IVmSolution)VmSolution.Instance).IsLoading && !ProjectManager.GetInstance().LoadSolution(solItem.SolPath, isGuid: false, (solItem.SolPassword == null) ? \"\" : solItem.SolPassword, null, isRemoteMode: false, isFromAppStart: false, isFromAppArgs: false, isShowSaveNotice == \"1\"))\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tloadSolutionResult = false;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tcatch (Exception ex)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tVmException ex2 = null;\n\t\t\tif (ex is VmException || ex.InnerException is VmException)",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        }
      ],
      "unknowns": [
        "LoadSolution返回true本身不证明已载入；取消/提示/异步worker与本地复位Task的竞态仍未知，尚未做原机消息注入。"
      ],
      "nextMembers": [
        "ProjectManager.LoadSolution overload and generated load worker",
        "SolItem.SolPassword XML/binding lifecycle"
      ],
      "priorLinks": [
        {
          "view": "solution-lifecycle",
          "id": "O01",
          "url": "solution-lifecycle.html#edge-O01"
        }
      ],
