      "verification": {
        "sourceHashesVerified": true,
        "runtimeExecuted": false,
        "nativeEquivalent": false,
        "currentImplementationMapped": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "EA05",
      "group": "通信回调换方案",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "from": "本地isLoading轮询及catch",
      "to": "等待看到加载开始或明确失败 → 写false",
      "behavior": "Task循环条件是!VmSolution.IsLoading && loadSolutionResult，每轮Sleep(1)，退出后才清本地isLoading。LoadSolution返回false或VmException分支会写loadSolutionResult=false；普通Exception仅提示/日志，不写该值。没有本Task的本地超时、取消或finally。因而不能将这段描述为加载完成后解锁，也不能从源码直接断言实际必挂。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VisionMaster.Exe.Audit/VisionMaster/MainWindowData.cs",
          "member": "receive wait and exception paths",
          "sha256": "aa7a20533b81452cd58fbd22e121273b3a109ce21b0841fc0d9e4d081939f1e5",
          "start": 1262,
          "end": 1304,
          "excerpt": "\t\tbool loadSolutionResult = true;\n\t\ttry\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tif (isLoading)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tisLoading = true;\n\t\t\tTask.Run(() =>\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\twhile (!((IVmSolution)VmSolution.Instance).IsLoading && loadSolutionResult)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tThread.Sleep(1);\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\tisLoading = false;\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tif (!((IVmSolution)VmSolution.Instance).IsLoading && !ProjectManager.GetInstance().LoadSolution(solItem.SolPath, isGuid: false, (solItem.SolPassword == null) ? \"\" : solItem.SolPassword, null, isRemoteMode: false, isFromAppStart: false, isFromAppArgs: false, isShowSaveNotice == \"1\"))\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tloadSolutionResult = false;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tcatch (Exception ex)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tVmException ex2 = null;\n\t\t\tif (ex is VmException || ex.InnerException is VmException)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tloadSolutionResult = false;\n\t\t\t\tex2 = ex as VmException;\n\t\t\t\tif (ex2 == null)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tex2 = ex.InnerException as VmException;\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\tLogHelper.Error(ex2.errorMessage);\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\telse\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tHikMessageBox.Show(ex.Message, MessageIcons.Error);\n\t\t\t\tLogHelper.Error(ex.Message);\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t}\n}\n",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        }
      ],
      "unknowns": [
        "跨线程可见性、Task异常、原加载状态是否翻转、取消路径是否返回true及实际等待时长未证；这是一段开始条件轮询而非完整结束通知。"
      ],
