          "start": 191,
          "end": 208,
          "excerpt": "\tprivate void ValueChanged(object sender, PropertyChangedEventArgs e)\n\t{\n\t\tif (!e.PropertyName.Equals(\"IsEventTrigger\") && !e.PropertyName.Equals(\"IsStrTrigger\") && !isSetChange && !e.PropertyName.Equals(\"EnumEntrysA\"))\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tif (e.PropertyName.Equals(\"Command\"))\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tisSetChange = true;\n\t\t\t\t(sender as ComTriggerItem).ClearConfig();\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tif (sender != null && sender is ComTriggerItem comTriggerItem && CheckPassword(comTriggerItem))\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tSetTriggerItem(comTriggerItem, ActionType.Modify);\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tisSetChange = false;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tprivate bool CheckPassword(ComTriggerItem tiggerItem)",
