      "behavior": "SolutionPath为空直接true；有效受保护方案但SolutionPasswd为空也true；密码检查nIsCorrect==0时提示、置isSetChange=true并清SolutionPasswd，仍返回true。仅异常路径记录并false。该bool不能命名为密码验证成功，ValueChanged在true后仍可调用Modify；底层是否拒绝空密码另待证。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.GlobalUI/GlobalTriggerConfig.cs",
