          "start": 208,
          "end": 245,
          "excerpt": "\tprivate bool CheckPassword(ComTriggerItem tiggerItem)\n\t{\n\t\ttry\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tif (string.IsNullOrEmpty(tiggerItem.SolutionPath))\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\treturn true;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tuint nHasPwd = 0u;\n\t\t\tuint nValidFormat = 0u;\n\t\t\tServerSDKManager.serverSDKManager.mSolutionManager.CheckSolution(tiggerItem.SolutionPath, ref nHasPwd, ref nValidFormat);\n\t\t\tif (nValidFormat == 1 && nHasPwd == 1)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tif (string.IsNullOrEmpty(tiggerItem.SolutionPasswd))\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\treturn true;\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\tint nIsCorrect = -1;\n\t\t\t\tServerSDKManager.serverSDKManager.mSolutionManager.CheckPassword(tiggerItem.SolutionPath, tiggerItem.SolutionPasswd, ref nIsCorrect);\n\t\t\t\tif (nIsCorrect == 0)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tHikMessageBox.Show(AppLocalizationService.GetLang(\"方案密码错误\"), MessageButtons.Normal, MessageIcons.Error);\n\t\t\t\t\tisSetChange = true;\n\t\t\t\t\ttiggerItem.SolutionPasswd = \"\";\n\t\t\t\t\treturn true;\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tcatch (Exception ex)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tLogHelper.Error(\"CheckPassword is error.\" + ex.ToString());\n\t\t\treturn false;\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn true;\n\t}\n\n\tpublic void RemoveItem(object item)\n\t{",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        },
