    {
      "id": "EA10",
      "group": "全局触发即时写入",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "from": "SetTriggerItem Modify分支",
      "to": "序列化null或字节setter异常仍可返回0",
      "behavior": "Add写AddTriggerEvent/AddTriggerString=\"true\"；Delete写零基索引；Modify序列化非null才写ModifyTriggerEvent-/ModifyTriggerString-字节键。Modify内部setter异常只日志，之后仍return0；序列化null也走return0。外层异常才return-1。所以本地返回0不证明成功写入或触发执行。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.GlobalUI/GlobalTriggerConfig.cs",
          "member": "GlobalTriggerConfig.SetTriggerItem complete body",
          "sha256": "8df3c3bb4b0b7e8f120ccc955133cba54c2fdbeb769c2be91644f454d9f5616d",
          "start": 609,
          "end": 665,
          "excerpt": "\tprivate int SetTriggerItem(ComTriggerItem item, ActionType action)\n\t{\n\t\ttry\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tif (DecorateSource == null)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\treturn -1;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tbool flag = item is GlobalTriggerEventItem;\n\t\t\tswitch (action)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\tcase ActionType.Add:\n\t\t\t\t(DecorateSource as VmModule).Params[flag ? \"AddTriggerEvent\" : \"AddTriggerString\"] = \"true\";\n\t\t\t\tbreak;\n\t\t\tcase ActionType.Delete:\n\t\t\t\t(DecorateSource as VmModule).Params[flag ? \"DeleteTriggerEvent\" : \"DeleteTriggerString\"] = (item.Index - 1).ToString();\n\t\t\t\tbreak;\n\t\t\tcase ActionType.Modify:\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tbyte[] array = SetTriggerBytes(item, flag);\n\t\t\t\tif (array != null)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tstring key = (flag ? \"ModifyTriggerEvent-\" : \"ModifyTriggerString-\") + (item.Index - 1);\n\t\t\t\t\ttry\n\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\t((IUserBytesData)(DecorateSource as VmModule).Params)[key] = array;\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\tcatch (Exception ex)\n\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\tLogHelper.Error(\"下发数据错误,\" + ex.ToString());\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\tbreak;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\treturn 0;\n\t\t}\n\t\tcatch (Exception ex2)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tif (ex2 is VmException ex3)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tLogHelper.Error(\"下发数据错误,\" + ex3.errorMessage);\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\telse\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tLogHelper.Error(\"下发数据错误,\" + ex2.ToString());\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\treturn -1;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tpublic override int SetParamUnit()\n\t{\n\t\treturn base.SetParamUnit();\n\t}\n}\n",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        }
      ],
      "unknowns": [
        "StructToBytes具体布局/限长/原native接收端、返回码到UI反馈和方案保存效果未证。"
      ],
      "nextMembers": [
