      "from": "RemoveItem",
      "to": "先解绑弱事件，再Delete，失败不在此重新订阅",
      "behavior": "事件/字符串项先RemoveHandler；SetTriggerItem(Delete)!=0直接返回，不进入集合移除与重新编号。成功才从对应集合移除并从1重新编号。故不能画成Delete失败后UI与订阅完全不变。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.GlobalUI/GlobalTriggerConfig.cs",
          "member": "GlobalTriggerConfig.RemoveItem",
          "sha256": "8df3c3bb4b0b7e8f120ccc955133cba54c2fdbeb769c2be91644f454d9f5616d",
          "start": 244,
          "end": 280,
          "excerpt": "\tpublic void RemoveItem(object item)\n\t{\n\t\tif (item is GlobalTriggerEventItem)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tWeakEventManager<GlobalTriggerEventItem, PropertyChangedEventArgs>.RemoveHandler((GlobalTriggerEventItem)item, \"PropertyChanged\", ValueChanged);\n\t\t}\n\t\telse if (item is GlobalTriggerStrItem)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tWeakEventManager<GlobalTriggerStrItem, PropertyChangedEventArgs>.RemoveHandler((GlobalTriggerStrItem)item, \"PropertyChanged\", ValueChanged);\n\t\t}\n\t\tif (SetTriggerItem(item as ComTriggerItem, ActionType.Delete) != 0)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t}\n\t\tint num = 1;\n\t\tif ((item as ComTriggerItem).IsEventTrigger)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tCommEventTriggerA.Remove(item);\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tforeach (object item2 in CommEventTriggerA)\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t(item2 as ComTriggerItem).Index = num;\n\t\t\t\t\tnum++;\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tCommStrTriggerA.Remove(item);\n\t\tforeach (object item3 in CommStrTriggerA)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\t(item3 as ComTriggerItem).Index = num;\n\t\t\tnum++;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\t/// <summary>\n\t/// 获取所有接收事件列表",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        }
      ],
      "unknowns": [
